{"id":"st2115","designation":"ST 2115","title":"Free Scale Gamut and Free Scale Log Characteristics of Camera Signals","state":"active","suite":null,"official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/st2115/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/st2115/","checked_at":"2026-11-11"},"scope":"This standard specifies the Free Scale Gamut (FS-Gamut) and the Free Scale logarithmic transfer characteristics (FS-Log) for camera signals. The FS-Gamut consists of chromaticity coordinates of red, green, and blue primaries and a white point. The FS-Gamut and FS-Log are specified in accordance with SMPTE ST 2048-1, in which these are originally specified for digital cinematography production. This standard also specifies names for specific sets of parameter values for FS-Gamut and FS-Log, and associated transfer characteristics for professional cameras that make use of FS-Gamut and FS-Log.","outline":[{"level":1,"title":"1 Scope","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"2 Conformance Notation","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"3 Normative References","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"4 Terms and Definitions","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.1 chromaticity coordinates","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.2 Free Scale Gamut FS-Gamut","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.3 Free Scale Log FS-Log","page":4},{"level":1,"title":"5 FS Colorimetry","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"5.1 Free Scale Gamut (FS-Gamut)","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"5.2 Free Scale Log (FS-Log)","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"5.3 Notation of parameter values","page":5},{"level":1,"title":"6 Color VANC","page":5},{"level":1,"title":"7 Parameter values of FS-Gamut and FS-Log","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"7.1 FS-Gamut parameter values","page":5},{"level":3,"title":"7.1.1 Camera Gamut S3","page":6},{"level":3,"title":"7.1.2 Camera Gamut SC","page":7},{"level":3,"title":"7.1.3 Camera Gamut V","page":8},{"level":3,"title":"7.1.4 Camera Gamut C","page":9},{"level":2,"title":"7.2 FS-Log parameter values","page":10},{"level":3,"title":"7.2.1 Came